# The Caddy image builds from the repository root (it needs web/ and the
# Caddyfile), so keep the build context small and free of local state.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/dist
**/.expo
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.git
server/data
server/.pytest_cache
greenpulse/greenpulse/runs
greenpulse/greenpulse/dataset
app
src
assets
scripts
skills
slides
# The ML team's package: 5 GB of datasets, never needed by the server or the
# panel. The model runs on the Pi, from the LeafNode repo's pi/weights.
GreenPulse 1
GreenPulse 1.zip
